googleTrusted.adminMessage:
Hello, I would like to connect my work Google account to Liaison ({{baseUrl}}), the workspace where our team handles mail, tickets and documents. Google asks an admin to allow it first. In admin.google.com, open Security, then Access and data control, then API controls, and click Manage App Access. Under Configured apps, click Configure new app, enter the client ID below, click Search and click Liaison. Keep the whole organisation as the scope (or choose our team's organisational unit), click Continue, choose Trusted, click Continue, then Finish.
{{clients}}
Trusted only lets people in our domain who choose to connect give Liaison access to their own account, and it can be revoked at any time on the same page. Thank you.
